[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3130.549, "timestamp": "00:52:10", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3136.39, "timestamp": "00:52:16", "text": "我們可以再試一次。或有很多夜間房價，但由於某些奇怪的原因，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3138.309, "timestamp": "00:52:18", "text": "我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3141.19, "timestamp": "00:52:21", "text": "不能使用這些房價"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3145.03, "timestamp": "00:52:25", "text": "。  嗯，我覺得我還能再來一次。  不過我也不確定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3161.27, "timestamp": "00:52:41", "text": "我們完成了這麼多工作。"}]